WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.500
Remember the seven minds
that vote on your decisions?

2
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.200
We gave them a board.

3
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.250
Each one moves like a chess piece,
and talks like itself.

4
00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.800
Ask them anything,
and all seven answer at once.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Yes... even about the weather.

6
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.620
But keep poking them...

7
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.750
...and find out who snaps first.

8
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.650
Come meet the council in person.

9
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:24.000
Then bring them your real decisions,
with /quorum.
